[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":98},["ShallowReactive",2],{"blog:archive:3":3},{"posts":4,"total":92,"tags":93,"tag":-1},[5,14,23,32,40,49,57,66,75,83],{"title":6,"link":7,"date":8,"dateTime":9,"description":10,"thumbnail":11,"tags":12},"【現在就走！前進企業帶你看】版塊設計的隱藏福利？版塊人都喜歡？","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-06-01-block-studio-interview","2022\u002F06\u002F01","2022-06-01","各 位 觀 眾！六角的全新採訪企劃 來了！嗨嗨我是Ｚ編，【現在就走！前進企業帶你看】將會由洧杰、卡斯伯，兩位老師前進前端、設計相關公司，替大家一探究竟 👀","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F05%2Fblock-studio%2F%E7%89%88%E5%A1%8A.png?alt=media&token=c8c5da00-a236-456c-804b-d9a56f77f97b",[13],"enterprise",{"title":15,"link":16,"date":17,"dateTime":18,"description":19,"thumbnail":20,"tags":21},"軟體工程師有哪些類別","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-05-30-software-engineer-category","2022\u002F05\u002F30","2022-05-30","軟體工程師領域廣闊，隨著軟體服務與日常生活越來越密不可分，相關職缺需求日益提高，但許多人仍然對此相關職務感到陌生，本篇就介紹主流的軟體工程師職務","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F05%2Fengineer-type%2F工程師各自負責的領域-02.png?alt=media&token=cd3c83cc-8881-48e0-8b08-4dd262f2c19e",[22],"software engineer",{"title":24,"link":25,"date":26,"dateTime":27,"description":28,"thumbnail":29,"tags":30},"【警察轉前端】 Alex 學習歷程Ｑ＆Ａ","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-05-23-alex-learning-process","2022\u002F05\u002F23","2022-05-23","Alex 畢業於警專，畢業後，在警界服務了五年，後來因考量自身狀態及未來發展，決定朝前端工程師發展，現在已是一名前端工程師，就讓我們一起來看看 Alex 的分享吧！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F05%2FAlex.png?alt=media&token=4a02f784-4539-4ff8-aef9-44e9ddc590b7",[31],"interview",{"title":33,"link":34,"date":35,"dateTime":36,"description":37,"thumbnail":38,"tags":39},"【從零開始】行銷企劃轉前端","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-05-19-marketing-specialist-to-frontend","2022\u002F05\u002F19","2022-05-19","打開職缺網，看到的都是軟體相關的工作，感嘆自己沒有硬技能，無法有更多的選擇。法文系畢業的 Ruta 從來沒想過自己有天會成為前端工程師，回想起來，她很感謝自己擁有的幸運和付出過的努力！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F05%2FRuta.png?alt=media&token=ba6abb13-12da-4c78-8aa4-4ba14d77cfbb",[31],{"title":41,"link":42,"date":43,"dateTime":44,"description":45,"thumbnail":46,"tags":47},"【徵才】視覺設計 實習生","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-05-16-design-internship","2022\u002F05\u002F16","2022-05-16","六角學院 是一所線上程式開發學習單位，目前已累積超過 30,000 名學員，讓更多人藉由線上學習在職涯規劃上有更多的選擇是我們的使命，如果您贊同我們的理念，歡迎加入六角。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F05%2Fhex-hire-intern-fb.png?alt=media&token=dffc89f2-dc10-4e2f-ba74-e4c45697f692",[48],"jobs",{"title":50,"link":51,"date":52,"dateTime":53,"description":54,"thumbnail":55,"tags":56},"海外同學也可以轉職前端工程師！保持一顆勇於接受挑戰的心！","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-05-03-frontend-abroad","2022\u002F05\u002F03","2022-05-03","海外同學也可以找到前端工作嗎？ Alysa 香港人，非本科系，畢業後雖然有做跟設計相關工作，但因為自己熱愛挑戰，因此決定轉換跑道。Alysa 透過一年的學習，終於轉職成功！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F05%2FBlog-09.png?alt=media&token=67fc4a19-d984-4113-a2cd-bce990dcd048",[31],{"title":58,"link":59,"date":60,"dateTime":61,"description":62,"thumbnail":63,"tags":64},"2022 前端開發者學習地圖","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-04-18-frontend-study-map","2022\u002F04\u002F18","2022-04-18","許多學員接觸六角，目的當然是為了轉職為前端，以及接下來在這條職業路上該如何發展，而依據每個人的過去經歷不同，也會產生不同的疑惑。在此，我們準備了 2022 年版，前端開發者學習地圖供學員參考 ～","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F04%2F18%2Fog.png?alt=media&token=9c731aa4-bd6d-4249-bc87-bd8be58f0ce2",[65],"skilltree",{"title":67,"link":68,"date":69,"dateTime":70,"description":71,"thumbnail":72,"tags":73},"JavaScript 程式解題組合包","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-04-15-js-solving-combined","2022\u002F04\u002F15","2022-04-15","我們是六角學院，到了現在已經培育出許多網頁開發者並成功進入業界，「JavaScript 程式解題組合包」特別推薦給想深入了解 JS 觀念與應用的開發者。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F04%2F15%2F2022_JavaScript_%E7%A8%8B%E5%BC%8F%E8%A7%A3%E9%A1%8C%E7%B5%84%E5%90%88%E5%8C%85-02.png?alt=media&token=23c5c732-cf78-48d9-a3e5-4320b20a10f4",[74],"course",{"title":76,"link":77,"date":78,"dateTime":79,"description":80,"thumbnail":81,"tags":82},"【大學生自學前端】不要怕，做就對了！","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-03-31-self-study-frontend","2022\u002F03\u002F31","2022-03-31","非本科、零基礎的文組生也可以成為前端工程師嗎？硯喬大三暑假開始線上自學，畢業後順利成為一名前端工程師，她鼓勵所有同學，不要怕，做就對了！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F03%2F31%2F%E7%A1%AF%E5%96%AC.png?alt=media&token=2181d82c-e32d-4744-a9a9-1f39fc5db769",[31],{"title":84,"link":85,"date":86,"dateTime":87,"description":88,"thumbnail":89,"tags":90},"【公益程式體驗營】擺脫動亂學前端， 掌握技能保平安","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-03-18-global-welfare","2022\u002F03\u002F18","2022-03-18","2022 年台灣仍飽受疫情影響，再加上國際動亂，許多家庭的生計因此大受影響，為此我們決定釋出學習資源，舉辦 【公益程式體驗營】 擺脫動亂學前端， 掌握技能保平安，讓大家藉由 30 天程式體驗營的特訓，探索自己是否適合成為工程師。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F03%2F18%2Fog.jpeg?alt=media&token=8e97d6d6-898c-46bc-a2d0-8e879599ae1e",[91],"event",116,[94,74,95,96,13,91,31,97,48,65,22],"UI design","css","css3","javascript",1790064291147]